---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="关于 · Cyrus"
  description="了解 Cyrus：背景、关注方向与联系方式。"
>
  <div class="container about-container">
    <header class="about-header">
      <h1 class="serif-title about-title">关于 Cyrus</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">
        热爱技术、探索系统边界与审美表达的开发者与独立思考者。在纷杂的信息中，锚定属于自己的认知坐标。
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-body">
      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>我是谁？</h2>
        <p>
          你好，我是 <strong>Cyrus</strong>。我长期关注计算机系统底层、软硬件交互机制、前沿 AI 智能体（Agent）架构以及数字化个人品牌建设。
        </p>
        <p>
          在日常生活中，我习惯通过动手实践去探究技术的本质——无论是拆解像 AnyPS5 这样的免模拟二进制重链接黑科技，还是尝试让大模型遵循严格的视觉语法绘制专业架构图。我深信：<strong>只有动手构建，才是最深刻的理解（What I cannot create, I do not understand）。</strong>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>关注与探索领域</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>自主 AI 智能体（Autonomous Agents）</strong>：记忆中枢、任务规划、工具调用沙盒与人机协同对齐。</li>
          <li><strong>系统底层与跨平台技术</strong>：二进制可执行文件格式（ELF/PE）、架构兼容层与高效运行机制。</li>
          <li><strong>数字美学与视觉呈现</strong>：拒绝庸俗的 AI 生成垃圾，追求以最高质感的信息图表和文字表达思想。</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>如何找到我？</h2>
        <p>如果你想交流技术、探讨想法或有合作意向，可以通过以下方式与我取得联系：</p>
        
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <!-- 0. Guestbook -->
          <a href="/guestbook" class="contact-card contact-link contact-highlight">
            <div class="contact-info">
              <div class="contact-header">
                <span class="contact-label">💬 站内留言板</span>
                <span class="contact-badge badge-guestbook">免登录 · 自由交流</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-val">欢迎前往留言板留下你的问候、足迹或想法</div>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">前往留言板 ↗</span>
          </a>

          <!-- 1. Email -->
          <div class="contact-card">
            <div class="contact-info">
              <div class="contact-header">
                <span class="contact-label">电子邮箱</span>
                <span class="contact-badge">深度合作 / 探讨</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-val">wangcyrus6@gmail.com</div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-actions">
              <button type="button" class="action-btn copy-btn" data-copy="wangcyrus6@gmail.com">一键复制</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. WeChat -->
          <div class="contact-card">
            <div class="contact-info">
              <div class="contact-header">
                <span class="contact-label">微信 WeChat</span>
                <span class="contact-badge badge-wechat">即时交流</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-val">
                wxcyrus060224 <span class="contact-hint">（添加请注明来意）</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-actions">
              <button type="button" class="action-btn copy-btn" data-copy="wxcyrus060224">复制微信号</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3. X (Twitter) -->
          <a href="https://x.com/CyrusW68175" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="contact-card contact-link">
            <div class="contact-info">
              <div class="contact-header">
                <span class="contact-label">X (Twitter)</span>
                <span class="contact-badge">思考与动态</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-val">@CyrusW68175</div>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">关注 / 私信 ↗</span>
          </a>

          <!-- 4. Telegram -->
          <a href="https://t.me/cyrus" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="contact-card contact-link">
            <div class="contact-info">
              <div class="contact-header">
                <span class="contact-label">Telegram</span>
                <span class="contact-badge badge-tg">极客与隐私交流</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-val">@cyrus</div>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">发起对话 ↗</span>
          </a>

          <!-- 5. GitHub -->
          <a href="https://github.com/Cyrus060224" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="contact-card contact-link">
            <div class="contact-info">
              <div class="contact-header">
                <span class="contact-label">GitHub</span>
                <span class="contact-badge">代码与开源足迹</span>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-val">@Cyrus060224</div>
            </div>
            <span class="link-arrow">浏览项目 ↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-footer-note">
          <span>⏱ 响应承诺：重要商务与深度来信通常在 24~48 小时内回复</span>
          <span class="mono-tz">UTC+8</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw + 1rem, 2.75rem);
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about-body ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .contact-card {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s var(--ease-obs);
  }

  .contact-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--rule-bold);
    background: var(--card-bg-elevated);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .contact-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-label {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .contact-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--accent-tint);
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .badge-guestbook {
    background: var(--accent-tint);
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .contact-highlight {
    border-color: var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .badge-wechat {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    color: #10b981;
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
  }

  .badge-tg {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
    color: #38bdf8;
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
  }

  .contact-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .contact-hint {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .action-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    padding: 5px 11px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--paper-2);
    color: var(--ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.18s ease;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .action-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .action-btn.primary-btn {
    background: var(--accent-tint);
    border-color: var(--accent-glow);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .action-btn.primary-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #05070B;
  }

  .action-btn.copied {
    border-color: #10b981;
    color: #10b981;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
  }

  .link-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-link:hover .link-arrow {
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .contact-footer-note {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .contact-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .contact-actions {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .link-arrow {
      align-self: flex-end;
    }

    .contact-footer-note {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.copy-btn').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      e.stopPropagation();
      const text = btn.getAttribute('data-copy');
      if (!text) return;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        const originalText = btn.textContent;
        btn.textContent = '已复制 ✓';
        btn.classList.add('copied');
        setTimeout(() => {
          btn.textContent = originalText;
          btn.classList.remove('copied');
        }, 1500);
      } catch (err) {
        console.error('Copy failed:', err);
      }
    });
  });
</script>
